{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "df818f0f32d6ad429d1b29d1438510f98116f9c86b5c5ed147101d0f844d5e73", "ja": "（『アイドルヒーローズ』シリーズのリバイバル公演の\n準備中。響の要望で、今日は客演のゲストも一緒だ）", "zh": "（正在为《偶像英雄》系列的复刻公演做准备。应响的要求，今天还有客串演出的嘉宾一起参加。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1001_p", "source_sha256": "372bd8785909ec6679fd936feeb92edb781a427ddf2c53a2f812af838fc1936c", "ja": "響、お疲れさま。\n……あれ、ハム蔵は？", "zh": "响，辛苦了。……咦，哈姆藏呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "df51f5fb36002fdc5e5b9930ef3e01e7ce26abe113887504a28764c34fc8453a", "ja": "ハム蔵ならバッグの中だぞ。\n今日はしっかり「お仕事」したからね。", "zh": "要说哈姆藏的话，它在包里哦。\n今天它也好好“工作”了一番呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1003_p", "source_sha256": "dc93cf287bc06c5c062c5a3c04fbb7cc7784979ab8e08d0b1b129b4ba882b449", "ja": "おっと、響だけじゃなくてハム蔵にも言わないとな。\nお疲れさま、ハム蔵。", "zh": "对了，不光要跟响说，也得跟哈姆藏说一声才行。\n辛苦了，哈姆藏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1004_p", "source_sha256": "17096512e7dfa147b3c5c59bd97fffefa4901387cf82ca33e7b107f6c61dd85a", "ja": "それにしても響もしっかりしているな。\n舞台にハム蔵を慣れさせたいなんて。", "zh": "话说回来，响也真是可靠啊。\n居然还想着让哈姆藏适应舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "de7cec84e051c7c8b5629285fab1612d77982c1a00894842979caa7389d50f3f", "ja": "ハム蔵は自分の大事な部下役だからね！　\n一緒に公演に出るのも、ちょっと久しぶりだし。", "zh": "因为哈姆藏是我重要的部下嘛！\n而且我们也有一阵子没一起参加公演了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "62e86b04f0b5e7383661d8926dbe00035fb9db40818ef03b42434df7e8648cea", "ja": "さすがに緊張するだろうから、舞台に出る感じとか\n早めに思い出してもらいたいんだ。", "zh": "毕竟它肯定会紧张，所以我想让它早点回想起登上舞台的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1007_p", "source_sha256": "18cdb41ce96828243fabd2fd6902b49aa67d45721510efee939158f9a9d7307b", "ja": "そうだよな。いつも通り響の懐にいてもらうとはいえ、\nその衣装姿だと狭……、だいぶ勝手が違うだろうし。", "zh": "是啊。虽说平时也会让你待在响的怀里，不过穿着那身服装的话，空……，感觉应该会很不一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1008_p", "source_sha256": "96f0e06937310fe1d5d5407093e9283c2091827bafd86846bf4dc3f4758b48ce", "ja": "でも今日の舞台の上では、響が激しく動いても、\nずっとおとなしくしてくれていたよな。……さすがだ。", "zh": "不过今天在舞台上，即使响剧烈活动，你也一直乖乖待着呢。……真不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "c020712c8452f433dbedc369588e01b95718103b7242c361b0fd8c153ca07157", "ja": "ふふーん、ハム蔵はかしこいからね！\nおとなしくするぐらい、お茶の子さいさいさー！", "zh": "哼哼，哈姆藏可是很聪明的！\n乖乖待着什么的，简直轻而易举啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9d53578cb6bfb6c98449b849198e5c471af17633b9a78fc1793a9074098599c6", "ja": "はは、響もハム蔵と共演できることが、\nうれしいみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，看来响也很高兴能和哈姆藏同台演出呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "0ca781925d1e6bcc5aa0a0a38eea594cf9728871dc99184195c77d8b72ec97da", "ja": "もちろんだぞっ。劇場のお客さんたちに、\n家族自慢する感じかな？", "zh": "当然啦。感觉就像是在向剧场的观众们\n夸耀自己的家人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "0bc4a58aceff626a6d3474a08e26ff676739cbc21ede15c634a30815e7c30f23", "ja": "映像をもらったら、今度はうちの家族みんなで見る\nつもり。よろしくね、{$P$}！", "zh": "拿到影像后，我打算下次和家里人一起看。拜托了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a5cc24c50e953453aa8b5cfef61745b9e5cb3ae3bb586d7a7a1963cd0bf7d72d", "ja": "わかってるよ。そもそもアップにしないと見えないし、\nハム蔵は多めに映してもらおう。", "zh": "我知道啦。毕竟不放大就看不清，\n让哈姆藏多入镜一些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8b5406a16fc21afef95227f785e15dacee70f18d4faab8c9b5e21380bc8e3a3b", "ja": "さて、衣装チェックも問題なかったし、\nそろそろ帰る支度をしようか。", "zh": "那么，服装检查也没问题了，差不多该收拾收拾回去了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "bdb310101b99319af503105880270290c23c684f37e1fa42f4ea251b34a7e88a", "ja": "うん！　……ハム蔵、着替えるから\nもうちょっとだけ待っててね。……あれ？", "zh": "嗯！……小哈姆，我要换衣服了，再等我一会儿哦。……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "d2c1980a6bac227257f4d23bb01f3a3d300697cee54123c202d91686af433584", "ja": "バッグの中にハム蔵が……いないぞ……？\nあれ？　どこ行っちゃったの？", "zh": "包里的小藏……不见了……？\n咦？跑到哪里去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1017_p", "source_sha256": "aec7421d899c1d2df03b6df27a81845d295b87081f312b0ece24f923e6d4be60", "ja": "なんだって？　じゃあこの部屋のどこかに……\nあっ。部屋のドアがちょっとだけ開いてる……？", "zh": "什么？那就是说……就在这个房间的某个地方……\n啊，房间的门好像只开了一点……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "7ba32b0fca23492833651b0de201566e75ddde9b11084cef595f088ccf6048e3", "ja": "うぎゃーっ！！\nおとなしくしててって言ったのに～！！", "zh": "呜哇——！！\n明明说了要老实待着的～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "7baf129b1281b79f2bfca427c3d59ba02b00f10dd2e0e61bde9b4f5c9aaa9701", "ja": "お～い、ハム蔵、どこ行ったんだ～？\n着替えたら帰るから、早く戻ってきてよ～！", "zh": "喂——！哈姆藏，你跑哪儿去了——？\n换好衣服我就回去了，所以快点回来啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0624_1020_hamuzou", "source_sha256": "665f4a322efaac7e64da7fa7baa085f9da9f6857182d274511d21a5a64dabd9d", "ja": "（キュー！）", "zh": "（啾！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
